h longer? It is clear that, in the long term, offsetting self-generated and unused solar energy will become less favorable. But what are the options? An expensive lithium battery is not a long-term solution either. And what do you do with surplus heat? We have listed a number of alternatives.      </em>”&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The article mentions: the Solyx Energy Water Accu, thermal storage in salt, heat pump boiler, heat pump and buffer tank, and heat pump and hot tap water.&nbsp;The <a href=\"https://www.solyxenergy.nl/solar-iboost/\">Solyx Energy Water Accu</a> is a combination of smart control, solar panels, and an electric boiler.&nbsp;</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>",
  "contentText": "Read the article \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nBy Margo van Voskuilen, Gawalo on 01.03.2023\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIn the article\n“Will we still be able to offset our energy consumption, or not? And if so, for how much longer? It is clear that, in the long term, offsetting self-generated and unused solar energy will become less favorable. But what are the options? An expensive lithium battery is not a long-term solution either. And what do you do with surplus heat? We have listed a number of alternatives.      ” \nThe article mentions: the Solyx Energy Water Accu, thermal storage in salt, heat pump boiler, heat pump and buffer tank, and heat pump and hot tap water. The Solyx Energy Water Accu is a combination of smart control, solar panels, and an electric boiler.",
